  m_text: '1. Click to select a cell.

    2.Press ''E'' to send virus to expand.
    Costs 50 virii.

    3. The virus grows exponentially. Virus above 250 causes
    the cell to burst.

    4.WASD to move and scroll to zoom, unzoom.

    5. Beware
    of NK Cells

'
